1718 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Pratt Microfabrication Facility \n\nThe Pratt Microfabrication Facility supports a wide range of silicon\055based fabrication activities including photolithography\054 oxidation\054 thin film deposition\054 plasma etching\054 wet etching\054 device processing\054 packaging and analysis\056 \n\nThe 400m2 facility is located on the 4th floor of the Pratt engineering building at the University of Toronto\054 and includes both a class 10\054000 \050ISO Class 7\051 microfabrication processing area and a class 1\054000 \050ISO Class 6\051 photolithography processing area\056 )
     /K [ 14 ]
     /P 1719 0 R
