1720 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Wallberg Nanolithography Facility \n\nThe Wallberg Nanolithography Facility \050an investment of over \0446 million\051 houses the state\055of\055the\055art Raith EBPG5000\053 Electron Beam Lithography System\056 The 108 m2 facility is located in the basement of the Wallberg building at the University of Toronto in order to achieve very low mechanical vibration of \07410 \274m\057s\056 \n\nTo ensure exceptional performance\054 the system is enclosed in an environmental chamber maintaining temperature stability of 21 \261 0\05625 \272C\054 0\0561 \272C\057hr\056 The 58 m2 Class 100 cleanroom lab space consists of the environmental chamber\054 control room\054 processing lab and gowning room\054 and contains a complete suite of equipment to perform nanolithography from CAD design to exposed resist development and analysis\056 )
     /K [ 15 ]
     /P 1721 0 R
     /Pg 1690 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
